Description: Library to parse and generate VEX documents (OpenVEX, CycloneDX, CSAF)
 Lib4VEX is a Python library for creating, parsing, and extracting vulnerability
 information from VEX documents. It supports multiple formats including OpenVEX,
 CycloneDX, and CSAF, offering a unified interface to work with 
 vulnerabilityinformation. 
 The library allows users to generate VEX documents, parse CycloneDX
 SBOMs, and export the results in JSON format. It is intended for developers
 needing consistent and format-agnostic handling of vulnerability information.
